    "$t": "烏魚哪ē炒米粉"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今年一下到立冬suah隨leh寒，真反常。Tsit幾工仔上班行過菜市仔，魚販仔lóng有leh賣烏魚殼，排--出-來--ê規尾烏lu烏lu，色緻tsiânn siāng，逐尾koh平大仔平大，kài成是兄弟姊妹--leh。「等khah寒--leh tsiah買來食。」有去tshi̍h著我ê烏魚興。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmHX3rn8gIRdPw3RlWm5qwR1vjJH1ssr1u06PoYJ2Ajr_W5RrPllLs8_Wu4Y4qVVybePRL5WlojdKMjfFp1dG6cUa1GbhOY0dq9xlHwVo236G9qoK6Q8M4niuhQoPDzDO5AfKpnSWt-HvsQK_2Mh78BUKah7wX73bQXezKP2Vwz-9dZLdVZvjFbFELtEg4/s1641/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8901.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"923\" data-original-width=\"1641\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhmHX3rn8gIRdPw3RlWm5qwR1vjJH1ssr1u06PoYJ2Ajr_W5RrPllLs8_Wu4Y4qVVybePRL5WlojdKMjfFp1dG6cUa1GbhOY0dq9xlHwVo236G9qoK6Q8M4niuhQoPDzDO5AfKpnSWt-HvsQK_2Mh78BUKah7wX73bQXezKP2Vwz-9dZLdVZvjFbFELtEg4/w640-h360/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8901.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6wE1ZCevhh-_cQcQczQgGEzmtTicyK1yBWFScqEHPQXBDq4O5-fmbpdcb-vLu4LEqr8dFuoEhxLN9p1K7FS-_nfBAzf9-14yvd9eyQzEvHlJiPWarxpL5B1SVhVuzt7MXtpe9Q7ZCTLwriAdNKwy0TJswJR66NxFJOWgRanq7TIVCd6YqK5h3xFCD5JI4/s923/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8902.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"923\" data-original-width=\"519\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6wE1ZCevhh-_cQcQczQgGEzmtTicyK1yBWFScqEHPQXBDq4O5-fmbpdcb-vLu4LEqr8dFuoEhxLN9p1K7FS-_nfBAzf9-14yvd9eyQzEvHlJiPWarxpL5B1SVhVuzt7MXtpe9Q7ZCTLwriAdNKwy0TJswJR66NxFJOWgRanq7TIVCd6YqK5h3xFCD5JI4/w360-h640/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8902.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjjUJraIlmwF0LcDreWcqYYXZWrpyi1dKZfgHoVA32-yppESOO1K2UAX-wSA7jYxQTtL4-N3I-XKFe9U9qPTWtkCbB0R9MYEpmJNklPQsyCTNK1k2EPeQVtSBT34sjZM0tU3Jvwt8lxOB56rMtMysGQ_4pid4zrYvU_xg3c4fraDPKCWsSR8X4Exj7QObD8/s923/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8903.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"923\" data-original-width=\"519\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjjUJraIlmwF0LcDreWcqYYXZWrpyi1dKZfgHoVA32-yppESOO1K2UAX-wSA7jYxQTtL4-N3I-XKFe9U9qPTWtkCbB0R9MYEpmJNklPQsyCTNK1k2EPeQVtSBT34sjZM0tU3Jvwt8lxOB56rMtMysGQ_4pid4zrYvU_xg3c4fraDPKCWsSR8X4Exj7QObD8/w360-h640/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8903.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgsFZKGkpbc-fOfBXcN4ddp8n8tbupjkyw83I-tN4OIbjPzgjfDyvwvE6xU0ieYqBLC_KlBL1HQxWz06_x5sIIwzMUeSo0WeAugAsQ0Cdd6voN8cbykAtEAQcbd8wdUBVRKFA_ik9ccH5nLgi_BH3H3Dp2QwncZFkzQVpHemk3He7s0CRURMoltkG3dN732/s923/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8905.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"923\" data-original-width=\"519\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgsFZKGkpbc-fOfBXcN4ddp8n8tbupjkyw83I-tN4OIbjPzgjfDyvwvE6xU0ieYqBLC_KlBL1HQxWz06_x5sIIwzMUeSo0WeAugAsQ0Cdd6voN8cbykAtEAQcbd8wdUBVRKFA_ik9ccH5nLgi_BH3H3Dp2QwncZFkzQVpHemk3He7s0CRURMoltkG3dN732/w360-h640/%E7%83%8F%E9%AD%9A%E5%93%AA%E6%9C%83%E7%82%92%E7%B1%B3%E7%B2%8905.jpg\" width=\"360\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><span><!--more--></span><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得細漢烏魚貴som-som，阿爹教lán講烏魚是好mi̍h。Hit-tsūn三頓ē得thang過就tsiok好--ah，khah ē有啥mih好料--ê iah是貴重ê食si̍t--leh？M̄-koh，若到冬節hit跤兜，飯桌頂拄著--à就ē有烏魚thang食。阿爹罕得教lán啥mih大道理，干干仔ē tī食烏魚ê hit-tang-tsūn，教lán講：「烏魚食著ē m̄驚寒，無錢mā tio̍h拆門扇枋去換烏魚，逐冬定著ài食。」Tsua̋n tsit句話tsiânn做是家訓，深深刻tī心內，對烏魚ê印象特別好，烏魚興是自然生--ê mā無啥thang龜怪--ê！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿娘煮烏魚ê手路，m̄是破爿煎赤赤，就是煎半熟lām蒜仔kue̍h破豆油，罕得仔ē煮烏魚米粉，偏偏阿娘tsit齣手路菜，我suah特別興，有kā khioh--起-來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我ē-hiáu煮食lóng是因為tsiok愛看阿娘煮食，m̄-tsiah有才調kā伊ê手路菜khioh--起-來。伊刣魚仔有夠頂真，bē輸龜毛。M̄-nā魚翼四箍圍仔ê鱗ē khioh清氣，連魚鰓蓋邊--a mā是khau kah清氣tang-tang，原來是阿爹tsiok討厭食著魚鱗ê關係。伊ē用湯匙仔尾kā魚肚內tī龍骨--裡ê烏tái血khau-hìnn-sak，講tse血ē hōo魚仔ke tsiok臭tsho，魚仔mā ē緊àu。烏魚beh剁kue̍h進前，ē kā菜刀攑踮刀石仔頂kuân huah--兩-三-下-仔，tsiah先tuì頭tsuî，魚尾叉bē剁掉，伊講：「Ài有頭有尾，tsiah ē圓滿。」爸母教--lán--ê suah lóng變做是lán ê信念。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿娘ē kā所有ê材料lóng款好tsiah起鼎，mā養成我慣勢án-ne煮食。見若烏魚落鼎煎，「tsha̋」--一-下，我就ē學黃俊雄布袋戲主角出--來定著ē講 ê su-lóo-gáng（slogan）：「金光tshiâng-tshiâng滾，烏魚炒米粉。」阿娘ē隨應講：「烏白講！烏魚哪ē炒米粉？是烏魚煮米粉湯。」伊suà--落-去ē講熱鼎、熱油煎魚仔tsiah bē tiâu鼎，koh教我píng魚仔。接suà ê步數伊ē一睏頭講kah了，ná leh背冊--leh：「烏魚表面煎赤--ah，就kā一屑仔豆油沿魚仔邊suî--落-去，koh píng--一-兩-遍，就lām蒜仔，火切khah細--leh，khàm蓋hip--一-下tsiah透水，水大滾lām鹽lām味素，胡椒beh食ê時隨人摻，落尾kā米粉囥--落-去，等滾就ē-sái去叫lín阿爹仔食飯--ah。」食烏魚米粉hit暗頓，阮tsiah ē有講有笑，tsiah看ē著阿爹仔pì-sù ê笑容。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">見斗歇睏我ē買烏魚，來煮烏魚米粉是我leh siàu念kap阿娘鬥陣ê法度；來食烏魚米粉是我leh liū阿娘ê滋味，一冬一冬一定ē suà--落-去。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFbI4AK34MUfjcKlYIXxbGo8BJ9dfZEBi0gFd01KctdAs2D8SFdS9Ee6f1RSPOa80dAtCRvivDBQD7RiZEexpfbyGTf0jAImZiCbMM6Bb4KP1bMQ1lwkqvYo4PWpvOhJNi2zhJEdgPw7Drh7UM63cwrXxqTS2aoD49gpIfYDjqq3rIK-3zzFZxGc8olRs_/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_36.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFbI4AK34MUfjcKlYIXxbGo8BJ9dfZEBi0gFd01KctdAs2D8SFdS9Ee6f1RSPOa80dAtCRvivDBQD7RiZEexpfbyGTf0jAImZiCbMM6Bb4KP1bMQ1lwkqvYo4PWpvOhJNi2zhJEdgPw7Drh7UM63cwrXxqTS2aoD49gpIfYDjqq3rIK-3zzFZxGc8olRs_/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_36.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAbDNArKzMcrYRNjc_1dWhsMsIyrzzgh_IeUMmi0R0inKwOXquVvLeC9JHEvgEqMlMJmTgVUqXoxLD4AG7vy1yAyK9jAvRC7YrbSPOKQ02tiLYGZbnGpf9rbjkz621iQVQGFEsi3qvWneYQ-qF9VvP_JTiPrUIK44Cjk78a8qGm7BR7AttAs67WKc6nU-r/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1357%E6%9C%9F_37.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgAbDNArKzMcrYRNjc_1dWhsMsIyrzzgh_Ie